 information access\, graph learning\, and semantic knowledge. Responsible
  Web and privacy research are substantive strands. Merely using a web dat
 aset or API is explicitly insufficient topical relevance.\nAdditional top
 ics: Knowledge Representation & Reasoning\, Data Mining & Data Science\, 
 Fairness & Responsible AI\, Privacy-preserving ML\, Ethics & Governance\n
 Scope sources (2027): https://www2027.thewebconf.org/research-track-paper
 s/\nScope last checked: 2026-10-07
URL:https://www2027.thewebconf.org/research-track-papers/
END:VEVENT
